Installing tfkiss
=================

From a release tarball
----------------------

    tar zxf tfkiss-VERSION.tar.gz
    cd tfkiss-VERSION
    ./configure
    make
    su -c "make install"

From a git clone
----------------

Building from git additionally requires autoconf and automake, and
one extra step to generate the configure script:

    ./autogen.sh
    ./configure
    make
    su -c "make install"

Configure options, the installation layout, and the configuration
required before first use are documented in README.  Please read it
before running tfkiss for the first time; at minimum you will need
to set your callsign and confirm the serial device.

Copyright and licensing are documented in LICENSE-NOTES.
